OL,3,GNEWSAMan attacked days before he was
OL,4,Akilled, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man told police he was assaulted by
OL,7,Fhis neighbour before being stabbed to
OL,8,Fdeath by the assailant 10 days later,
OL,9,Fan inquest jury heard.
OL,11,FCalvin Babatunde, 48, died shortly
OL,12,Fafter being stabbed in the neck at his
OL,13,Fflat in Fen Street, Milton Keynes, in
OL,14,FJanuary 2024.
OL,16,FJay Lupton, who also lived in Fen
OL,17,FStreet and is in his 20s, was last year
OL,18,Fmade the subject of a hospital order
OL,19,Fafter admitting Babatunde's
OL,20,Fmanslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
