OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest in Milton Keynes heard that
OL,7,FBabatunde, who had arthritis and used a
OL,8,Fcrutch, also told a friend "he tried to
OL,9,Fstab me" less than a month before he
OL,10,Fdied.
